      "math_academy_id": "e-2584",
      "problem": "Which numbered angle refers to the same angle as $\\widehat{GHA}?$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14131632/assets/47841a386b57f8615897cb73b1b98f15e975c78722f29d8baca92e7c7663a527.png)",
      "worked_solution": "If we trace along the letters of the angle name, from $G$ to $H$ to $A$,  we see that $\\widehat{GHA}$ refers to the angle $\\angle 3.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14131632/assets/100349e33233f2152ce236be2d17dc2fe3a59035a88336e26554eb6864d6059a.png)\n\nTherefore, $\\angle{3}$ is another name for $\\widehat{GHA}.$",
